      "explanation_md": "La segunda es el triple de la primera: la misma recta, infinitas soluciones."
    },
    {
      "id": "m02l06-x3", "kind": "numeric", "difficulty": 3, "skill_ids": ["irrational_equations"],
      "prompt_md": "Resuelve $\\sqrt{x+3}=x-3$. (Escribe la única solución válida.)",
      "key": {"value": 6, "tolerance": 0},
      "explanation_md": "$x+3=x^2-6x+9$ → $x^2-7x+6=0$ → $6$ o $1$. Con $x=1$: $\\sqrt4=2\\neq-2$ ✗. Solución $x=6$."
    },
    {
      "id": "m02l06-x4", "kind": "numeric", "difficulty": 2, "skill_ids": ["rational_equations"],
      "prompt_md": "Resuelve $\\dfrac{4}{x+2}=1$.",
      "key": {"value": 2, "tolerance": 0},
      "explanation_md": "Con $x\\neq-2$: $4=x+2$ → $x=2$."
    },
    {
      "id": "m02l06-x5", "kind": "multiple_choice", "difficulty": 3, "skill_ids": ["rational_equations"],
      "prompt_md": "¿Cuántas soluciones tiene $\\dfrac{x}{x-2}=\\dfrac{2}{x-2}$?",
      "choices": [{"id": "a", "text": "Ninguna"}, {"id": "b", "text": "Una: $x=2$"}, {"id": "c", "text": "Infinitas"}, {"id": "d", "text": "Dos"}],
